---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' Beyond the two-note case from the issue: with three members and three
' colors, all three must stay distinct, not just the first/last pair.
class F {
  int red
  int green
  int blue
}
note right of F::red #red
  red note
end note
note right of F::green #green
  green note
end note
note right of F::blue #blue
  blue note
end note
@enduml
